## Interface: 16001
## Title: |cffffd100Everlook|r |cff66bbffCompactChat|r
## Notes: Shows say, yell, party, raid, guild, officer, instance, and whisper lines as a short label (S, Y, P, PL, R, RL, RW, G, O, I, IL, W, or To), the name, then the message, with no brackets, and a numbered channel as its number.
